This package installs proprietary software, so it cannot be redistributed
through the Arch Linux repositories or the AUR as a binary artifact: the
source, "SW32_S32DS_3.6.10_RFP_D2607_linux.x86_64.bin", may only be obtained
from NXP with an nxp.com account and is subject to the NXP Software License
Agreement.

The PKGBUILD runs the vendor installer unattended and installs the resulting
files into /opt/s32-design-studio; it does not modify, wrap or relicense any
of them.  A copy of the license agreement and of the third party licenses NXP
redistributes with the product is installed in
/usr/share/licenses/s32-design-studio and in
/opt/s32-design-studio/License.

The full text of the NXP terms is part of the installer: run

  ./SW32_S32DS_3.6.10_RFP_D2607_linux.x86_64.bin

and accept the EULA shown by the GUI, or read
/opt/s32-design-studio/License after the package is built.
